EXPENSIVE HINT#1

A THOUSAND GOLD PIECES REALLY ISN'T MUCH IN THIS GAME UNLESS YOU ARE
LESS THAN 4TH LEVEL. THE BEST THING YOU CAN DO NOW IS START TO BUILD
UP YOUR RIDING SKILLS AND LANGUAGE SKILLS. IN ORDER TO COMPLETE THE
FIRST QUEST YOU WILL HAVE TO BE ABLE TO READ THE CLUES THAT AUGMENTEN
LEAVES BEHIND AS HE TRAVELS FROM PLACE TO PLACE AND HE ENJOYS WRITING
IN CONFOUNDED TONGUE WHICH THE NORMAL PERSON WILL BE UNABLE TO READ.

ONCE YOU HAVE THE SKILL TO RIDE A FLYING BEAST THEN START PUMPING ALL
OF YOUR LEVEL BONUS POINTS INTO LANGUAGE SKILLS TILL YOU ARE AT LEVEL
50. THIS WILL ENSURE YOU CAN READ ALL THE MESSAGES.

THE "SPECIAL" (WHICH IS IN THE REGISTERED VERSION) REQUIRES A MINIMUM OF
100 POINTS BEFORE IT CAN BE USED. IT IS SORT OF A POINT STORAGE WHICH
EVENTUALLY CAN BE USED TO BUY SPECIAL ABILITIES AND POWERS.